"2119695748317249694"], "id": "2119695748317249694", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 304, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "#a股# #股票# A股三大指数今日涨跌不一，截至收盘，上证指数涨0.32%，深证成指跌0.27%，创业板指跌0.27%，北证50涨0.82%，科创50指数涨0.3%。板块题材上，煤炭开采加工、元件、燃气、6G概念、卫星导航板块涨幅居前；能源金属、光伏设备、游戏、保险、汽车整车跌幅居前。", "url": "https://x.com/Maksek1234/status/2119695748317249694"}, {"author_id": "2851487822", "created_at": "2026-11-09T04:46:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119652718952538211"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/Nv4WXTDLDz", "end": 148, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/hiply0625/status/2119652718952538211/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2119652711096516608", "start": 125, "url": "https://t.co/Nv4WXTDLDz"}]}, "id": "2119652718952538211", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 104, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "一、A股行情分析 \n📊【11月9日A股早盘观察｜三大指数集体高开】\n📈A股迎来反弹开局！沪指开盘3659.02点（+0.27%），深成指11273.28点（+0.87%），创业板指2494.63点（+1.19%）。创业板领涨，科技成长方向表现积极。 https://t.co/Nv4WXTDLDz", "url": "https://x.com/hiply0625/status/2119652718952538211"}, {"author_id": "1884443497052143617", "created_at": "2026-11-08T23:22:42.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119571342341132642"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/5i7yD7jV8y", "end": 152, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/jack500peng/status/2119571342341132642/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2119571277224566784", "start": 129, "url": "https://t.co/5i7yD7jV8y"}]}, "id": "2119571342341132642", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 303, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 7, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "我爸炒股30年，他说周一开盘先看量，不看点位。\n\n上周的数字我先摆出来：美股那边，纳指一周跌了3.37%，标普跌2.68%，纳指100跌了4.91%；A股这边，上证一周涨1.39%，科创50涨了7.96%。同一周，两边完全反着走，这才是上周最值得记住的事。 https://t.co/5i7yD7jV8y", "url": "https://x.com/jack500peng/status/2119571342341132642"}, {"author_id": "1708722885639151616", "created_at": "2026-11-09T00:54:24.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119594418638553423"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/6YrBBXVLFs", "end": 181, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/enshiayu/status/2119594418638553423/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2119594198135713792", "start": 158, "url": "https://t.co/6YrBBXVLFs"}]}, "id": "2119594418638553423", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "一、今日最重要的5条消息\n1. A股算力硬件持续承压，11月6日创业板跌近4%\n发生日期：11月6日｜来源：财联社11月6日，A股市场出现明显的科技板块抛售：\n指标11月6日表现上证指数-1.10%深证成指-2.57%创业板指-3.96%两市成交额约1.66万亿元较前一交易日缩量约4602亿元下跌股票超4700只 https://t.co/6YrBBXVLFs", "url": "https://x.com/enshiayu/status/2119594418638553423"}, {"author_id": "36120873", "created_at": "2026-11-09T05:43:16.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119667114596557240"], "id": "2119667114596557240", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 139, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "A股午评：三大指数高开冲高后回落，午盘集体小涨，但个股跌多涨少，热点集中在科技硬件+资源/防御方向。\n\n指数（午间收盘）\n\n• 上证指数：3665.94 点，+0.46%，成交额约 4553 亿 \n\n• 深证成指：11206.24 点，+0.27%，成交额约 5541 亿\n\n• 创业板指：2478.94 点，+0.56%，成交额约 2865 亿\n\n•", "url": "https://x.com/EnisY/status/2119667114596557240"}, {"author_id": "1525834383529283585", "created_at": "2026-11-09T08:50:45.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119714298683609218"], "id": "2119714298683609218", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 29, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "沪指涨了，为什么多数股票还在跌？\n\n#A股# #财经观察#\n\n11月9日，A股收盘出现了一个让不少股民困惑的现象：上证指数上涨0.32%，收于3660.79点，但全市场超过3100只股票下跌。\n\n深证成指和创业板指均下跌0.27%。全市场成交额约1.49万亿元，比上一交易日减少1770亿元。\n\n指数是红的，账户却未必赚钱。", "url": "https://x.com/Tebilan986/status/2119714298683609218"}, {"author_id": "1860152938657943552", "created_at": "2026-11-09T01:22:22.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119601459197329682"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/OdrEKwb5kc", "end": 161, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/FG731314/status/2119601459197329682/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2119601451743977472", "start": 138, "url": "https://t.co/OdrEKwb5kc"}]}, "id": "2119601459197329682", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 922, "like_count": 8, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "目前A股属于政策托底、存量博弈、结构分化。上周五上证收3649点，跌1.1%，成交1.67万亿，缩量4600亿；创业板跌3.96%，科创50跌2.6%，高位科技股承压明显。\n\n技术面\n\n3610点是短线强支撑，上周五低点已获承接；3600点是政策底与心理关口，跌破概率较低。 https://t.co/OdrEKwb5kc", "url": "https://x.com/FG731314/status/2119601459197329682"}, {"author_id": "1945259172574191616", "created_at": "2026-11-09T03:37:36.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119635491771322593"], "id": "2119635491771322593", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 170, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "11月09日 午盘·连板天梯·概念版\n\n上证指数 3665.94 +0.46% +16.76\n涨2650｜跌2707\n今日成交额10181亿，较上一日此时缩量-1127亿\n主线：航天(16)、机器人(12)、大消费(5)、AI(4)、国产芯片(3)、新能源(3)、高端制造(2)、PCB板(1)、航运(1)、其他(4)\n标识说明：N炸板次数、高60日新高、N累计涨停", "url": "https://x.com/ConcettaTy54805/status/2119635491771322593"}, {"author_id": "1426928017415098370", "created_at": "2026-11-09T08:00:25.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119701629456748941"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 3, "start": 0, "tag": "A股"}, {"end": 7, "start": 4, "tag": "收评"}, {"end": 11, "start": 8, "tag": "实盘"}, {"end": 15, "start": 12, "tag": "算力"}, {"end": 20, "start": 16, "tag": "半导体"}]}, "id": "2119701629456748941", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 2571, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "#A股 #收评 #实盘 #算力 #半导体 \n\n【1109 收评复盘：缩量磨底，主力在玩“暗度陈仓”】\n \n今天收盘，上证勉强红了0.32%，但深成指和创业板都在水下。最直观的感受就是：难做。 两市成交额缩到了1.48万亿，比上周五少了1700多亿。涨的票2242只，跌的3148只，跌多涨少。", "url": "https://x.com/IrisChuang4/status/2119701629456748941"}, {"author_id": "1659674300272758786", "created_at": "2026-11-09T04:25:22.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_